    "created_at": "2016-08-10T18:11:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-10T18:11:58Z",
    "body": "This is great, I'll merge it. Note however that we have kind of an ecosystem problem where different specs are redefining the fetching process for `<link>`, instead of using this centralized definition :(. See #1142, #968, https://github.com/w3c/manifest/issues/481.\n\n/cc @zcorpan, @igrigorik, @mounirlamouri, @marcoscaceres as FYIs. We should really work to clean up this cross-spec mess.\n\nBut in any case, this is a definite improvement and takes care of the 80% case.\n",
